StopWatch Hub contains components under different licenses. There is no single
repository-wide license.

- MIT-licensed files are covered by LICENSES/MIT.txt.
- PrintSphere-derived files are covered by LICENSES/FNCL-1.1.txt and are
  restricted to non-commercial use unless separately licensed by the
  PrintSphere copyright holder.

See NOTICE.md and file-level SPDX identifiers for the applicable license and
attribution. Unless a file says otherwise, `bridge/`, `firmware/app_codex/`,
`firmware/hub_*`, project tooling, and tests are MIT; `vendor/PrintSphere`,
`firmware/app_printsphere/`, `firmware/printsphere_core/`,
`firmware/printsphere_m5/`, and `scripts/prepare_printsphere_port.py` are FNCL
v1.1. A firmware image containing PrintSphere-derived code is not an entirely
MIT-licensed binary.
